==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|sentīens||feeling, perceiving|lang=la}}, present active participle of {{term|sentiō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsɛn.ʃənt/|/ˈsɛn.ti.ˌənt/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# 1. Sense perception not involving intelligence or mental perception; feeling.
# 2. Mentally aware.
# {{context|chiefly|in|_|science fiction|lang=en}} Possessing human-like knowledge and intelligence.

====Antonyms====
* [[insensate]]

